    "Lie on the back, hands behind the head, legs long and hip-width, feet flexed.",
    "Breathe in to curl the head up; breathe out to roll up and fold over the legs.",
    "Breathe in to stack the spine up tall.",
    "Hinge back with a long spine, then breathe out to tuck and roll down bone by bone."
